  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Resilience and Recovery in Mykolaiv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project represents a natural continuation of existing interventions conducted within the framework of the International Organization for Migration (IOM)/Danish Ministry of Foreign Affairs in Mykolaiv, to address early recovery and winter needs of affected populations whilst providing support to the Mykolaiv authorities in addressing needs. IOM, in coordination and with the support of the Mykolaiv authorities, is largely supporting water, sanitation and hygiene improvements, winter needs &#x2013; including access to alternative energy sources &#x2013; and direct support to displaced and affected populations.</narrative>
  </description>
